# .graphifyignore — Graphify index scoping (same syntax as .gitignore, incl. ! negation).
# Graphify already respects .gitignore in every directory (node_modules, .venv,
# dist, build, etc. are usually excluded there). List here what git TRACKS but
# coding agents should not index — generated files, migrations, vendored code,
# and minified blobs otherwise pollute symbol search.
# EDIT THIS LIST for your repo; the entries below are illustrative.

**/migrations/**
*.min.js
*.min.mjs
*.generated.*
__pycache__/
vendor/
reference/
